~ start

ROSIE: Hello.
PLUM: Wa! (suprised)
ROSIE: Sorry... I didn't mean to scare you. (sad)
PLUM: I didn't think another girl would be there.
ROSIE: I'm Rosie! 

$> GameState.mark_event_seen("met_rosie")

if GameState.was_event_seen("rosie_grave_seen")
	PLUM: Oh! You're the girl on the grave right... Do you live here?
else
	PLUM: That's a pretty name. Do you live here.

ROSIE: I used to... I died here a while ago.
PLUM: Oh... (sad)
ROSIE: You seem like a nice girl. (happy)

if GameState.was_event_seen("rosie_grave_flower")
	ROSIE: Thank you for leaving the floweer on my grave... (Happy)

ROSIE: I'll be watching over you. 

=> END